This appendix collects the foundational results from operator theory, differential geometry, optimal transport, and statistical learning theory that underpin the six theoretical contributions of CogDynamics++. No originality is claimed here; the purpose is to provide a self-contained reference so that each proof in Appendix B can be followed without external lookup.

